  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-maroon pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absorption Polearm Construction</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/07/Slashuur_Scythe.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180402004816\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Slashuur Scythe\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/07/Slashuur_Scythe.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180402004816\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/07/Slashuur_Scythe.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180402004816 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/07/Slashuur_Scythe.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180402004816 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Slashuur Scythe\" width=\"270\" height=\"203\" data-image-key=\"Slashuur_Scythe.gif\" data-image-name=\"Slashuur Scythe.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Slashuur's (Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles 2: Battle Nexus) scythe, Gengetsu, drains his opponents' life force and feeds it to its wielder.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Construct polearm weapons capable of absorption.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>create polearm weapons capable of absorption</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Weaponry\" title=\"Absorption Weaponry\">Absorption Weaponry</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Polearm_Construction\" title=\"Polearm Construction\">Polearm Construction</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Polearm_Construction%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can create <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pole_weapon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Pole weapon\">pole-arms</a>, including <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Glaive\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Glaive\">glaives</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pollaxe_(Polearm)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Pollaxe (Polearm)\">poleaxes</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halberd\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Halberd\">halberds</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Naginata\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Naginata\">naginatas</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spear\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Spear\">spears</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halberd\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Halberd\">halberds</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scythe\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Scythe\">scythes</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guan_dao\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Guan dao\">guan dao</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trident\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Trident\">tridents</a>, etc., that are capable of absorption.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Polearm_Construction%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Slash\" title=\"Absorption Slash\">Absorption Slash</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cutting\" title=\"Cutting\">Cutting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Inducement\" title=\"Death Inducement\">Death Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Impale\" title=\"Impale\">Impale</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Pain_Inducement\" title=\"Pain Inducement\">Pain Inducement</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Polearm_Construction%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Weaponry\" title=\"Absorption Weaponry\">Absorption Weaponry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Polearm_Construction\" title=\"Polearm Construction\">Polearm Construction</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Polearm_Construction%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May only be able to absorb certain items, like life-force or the elements.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Polearm_Construction%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Gengetsu (<i>Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles 2: Battle Nexus</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260803144842\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 109/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 177/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (